OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed as police deal with
OL,4,Arooftop incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road in Coventry has been
OL,7,Fclosed and drivers are facing
OL,8,Fdisruption while emergency services
OL,9,Frespond to an incident involving a man
OL,10,Fon the roof of a building.
OL,12,FPolice were called to Foleshill Road at
OL,13,Fabout 14:00 BST on Tuesday and remain
OL,14,Fat the scene alongside other emergency
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,FA West Midlands Police spokesperson
OL,18,Fsaid: "We are currently on Foleshill
OL,19,FRoad along with other emergency
OL,20,Fservices due to a man being on the roof
OL,21,Fof a building.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
